The controller’s private helpers that call `findAllOwners` (all in `OwnerRestControllerV1.java`): `isDuplicateHousehold` (:261-265), `countOwnersInCity` (:274-278), `countOwnersRegisteredOn` (:304-308), `buildCustomerCode` (:227-234), `countNamesakes` (:254-259). Each streams `findAllOwners()` in memory — so a single create issues multiple full-table reads.

